tegra-drm: struct drm_atomic_state is drm_atomic_commit in Linux 7.3

Linux 7.3 renamed struct drm_atomic_state to struct drm_atomic_commit
(the helpers moved to drm_atomic_commit_*). r39 builds tegra-drm with
CONFIG_DRM_TEGRA_HAVE_DISPLAY, so the display code (dc, hub) uses the
struct as well; rename every use. No drm_atomic_state_* helper is
called here, so only the struct name changes.

